@ Start

- Melusina
  Look, Sir Melodious! A small creature is grazing by the resonance spring. Its wool glows with iridescent chromatic sheen.

- Sir Melodious
  A Choral Sheep! A motif creature of the first octave. Listen to the small bell around its fleece—it chimes in middle C.

* Sing a gentle call in middle C. | -> CallResponse
* Approach slowly and offer resonant grass. | -> ApproachSlowly

<@> ApproachSlowly

- Melusina
  Softly now... here is sweet dew clover.

- Sir Melodious
  It tilts its head, listening for your melodic pitch before it trusts us.

-> CallResponse

<@> CallResponse

- Melusina
  Do-mi-sol... (Melusina sings a warm, clear triad matching the bell cadence).

- .
  The Choral Sheep bleats in harmonized resonance, a pure and joyful C-major chord echoing from its fleece.

$ Notify melodia:stat:intent.choral_sheep.call_response:melodia_harmony:2

- Sir Melodious
  It has answered your pitch! The bond of resonance is struck. It wants to travel with us!

$ Notify melodia:flag:flag.companion.choral_sheep_recruited:true
$ Notify melodia:reward:reward.companion.choral_sheep

- Melusina
  Welcome to our ensemble, little one. We will explore the resonant world together.

$ Notify melodia:questcomplete:quest.companion.choral_sheep:flag.companion.choral_sheep_completed:reward.companion.choral_sheep:intent.companion.choral_sheep.complete:checkpoint.companion.choral_sheep.complete

@ Finish

- .
  The Choral Sheep joins Melusina's party as a faithful motif companion, ready to chime during exploration and rhythm battles.

$ End
